title: Public projects
description: Read-only pages for projects an admin made public. Anyone with the link can read, nobody can edit, and visitors are shown as a count.
connects:
  - to: src/lib/sync
    label: read-only sync
    description: Visitors hold no Realtime connection. They re-read the document's snapshot and update log every 20 seconds while the tab is visible, and the same request is their heartbeat for the "N watching" count.
